SUMMARY:4th Annual Family Fun Fest
DESCRIPTION:Davis Chamber of Commerce presents the 4th Annual Family Fun Fest Friday\, September 5\, 2026 \nPack a blanket and bring the family! Enjoy live music\, hands-on games\, face painting\, roaming photos\, delicious food trucks\, and fun activities for all ages while connecting with dozens of local businesses and nonprofits—all during one joyful\, free evening together.
